#: ../../source/index.md:3 67e58d69d0c24c159ff6db5491bed1c1
msgid ""
"Welcome to the documentation for **FiveAges Sim** — a multi-repository "
"ROS 2 robotics ecosystem for control, simulation, and deployment "
"developed by [FiveAges](https://github.com/fiveages-sim)."
msgstr ""
"欢迎阅读 **FiveAges Sim** 文档 — 这是由 [FiveAges](https://github.com/fiveages-sim) 开发的多仓库 ROS 2 机器人生态系统，覆盖控制、仿真与部署。"

#: ../../source/index.md:8 64b275945628426a8331832d35f3bddd
msgid ""
"New here? Start with the [Learning Path](0-overview/2-learning_path.md) "
"to understand the stack, then follow [Quick Demo (Public "
"Path)](1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md) to get a robot moving in"
" simulation within minutes."
msgstr ""
"第一次来？请先阅读[学习路径](0-overview/2-learning_path.md)以了解技术栈，然后按照[快速演示（公开路径）](1-getting_started/1-quick_demo_public.md)操作，几分钟内即可在仿真中让机器人动起来。"

#: ../../source/index.md:11 faae0e56cd9a4aa4ab5e8861e0e20ee2
msgid "About This Ecosystem"
msgstr "关于本生态系统"

#: ../../source/index.md:13 2d0b64cadcef43649cecb334381d5fe2
msgid "FiveAges Sim provides:"
msgstr "FiveAges Sim 提供："

#: ../../source/index.md:15 e64ded23bda14c1ba5bbf8c57444596a
msgid ""
"**Unified robot descriptions** — URDF/xacro packages for humanoids, "
"manipulators, and mobile robots"
msgstr "**统一的机器人描述** — 覆盖人形机器人、机械臂和移动机器人的 URDF/xacro 软件包"

#: ../../source/index.md:16 68f6bd76fd41408a80d147ac23a0a931
msgid ""
"**Hardware interfaces** — ROS 2 control plugins for various robot "
"platforms (Dobot, ARX, Galbot, HT, and more)"
msgstr "**硬件接口** — 适用于多种机器人平台（Dobot、ARX、Galbot、HT 等）的 ROS 2 control 插件"

#: ../../source/index.md:17 bbaafea629c04642acc75439a320eeec
msgid "**MPC controllers** — OCS2-based arm and whole-body controllers"
msgstr "**MPC 控制器** — 基于 OCS2 的机械臂与全身控制器"

#: ../../source/index.md:18 a58e49aa188b40779a113b6f358f02e7
msgid "**Simulation backends** — Gazebo Harmonic and NVIDIA Isaac Sim integration"
msgstr "**仿真后端** — 集成 Gazebo Harmonic 与 NVIDIA Isaac Sim"

#: ../../source/index.md:19 62913fdee50644d489d1d8004fbea55a
msgid ""
"**Teleop solutions** — VR, drag teaching, DexCap, and glove-based "
"teleoperation"
msgstr "**遥操作方案** — VR、拖动示教、DexCap 以及基于手套的遥操作"

#: ../../source/index.md:20 6f0f283142d64515ac1a2e1c070da29b
msgid ""
"**Python libraries** — High-level interfaces for robot control and data "
"collection"
msgstr "**Python 库** — 用于机器人控制与数据采集的高层接口"

